OL,3,GNEWSAVan attacker who strangled woman
OL,4,Ajailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn attacker who hit a woman with a van
OL,7,Fbefore strangling her in an attempted
OL,8,Fkidnapping has been jailed for 10
OL,9,Fyears.
OL,11,FSafiya Haverty, previously known as
OL,12,FSean Haverty, was sentenced at
OL,13,FWinchester Crown Court on Friday after
OL,14,Fbeing convicted of kidnap, assault
OL,15,Fcausing actual bodily harm, dangerous
OL,16,Fdriving and perverting the course of
OL,17,Fjustice.
OL,19,FPolice said Haverty, 28, from Newquay,
OL,20,Fwas born a biological male but
OL,21,Fidentifies as a woman.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
