OL,4,Ajailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe court previously heard the victim,
OL,7,Fa woman in her 50s, was walking along
OL,8,FMicheldever Road, in Andover, on 2
OL,9,FMarch when she was hit from behind by a
OL,10,Fwhite van.
